            <h2 class="section-title">About Electrophoresis Equipment</h2>

            <h3 class="section-title">GEL CASTING TRAYS</h3>
            <p>EDVOTEK injection-molded casting trays (also called gel beds) are available in two sizes, providing flexibility for a variety of experimental options. The rubber end caps fit tightly onto the ends of the gel casting tray. This feature eliminates the problem of agarose solution associated with casting trays that require the ends of the gel bed to be closed with tape.</p>

            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 30px; margin: 20px 0;">
