            <h3 class="section-title">WELL-FORMER TEMPLATES (COMBS)</h3>
            <p>Two different well former templates (combs) are available for EDVOTEK injection-molded electrophoresis units (Models M6+, M12 and M36). The standard 6-tooth comb and the Double comb 8/10 provide flexibility for a variety of experimental options.</p>
            <ul>
