<div class="page">
  <header style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">EDVO-Kit # {{ kit_number }}</div>
    <div style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">19</div>
  </header>
  <h2 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Conducting Agarose Gel Electrophoresis</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">ELECTROPHORESIS SAMPLES</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5;">Samples in EDVO-Kit Series 100 and Sci-On® Series electrophoresis experiments are packaged in one of two different formats:</p>
