      <p style="font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;">Staining is not required for Experiment #{{ experiment_number }}, but results must be analyzed upon completion of the electrophoretic separation. Because dye molecules are extremely small they will diffuse out of the gel. Thus, the gel cannot be saved.</p>
